<title>USA: Brazoria County MUD 3, Texas, won by Rauscher.</title>
<headline>Brazoria County MUD 3, Texas, won by Rauscher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes, Inc said it won $4.665 million of Brazoria County Municipal Utility District No. 3, Texas, waterworks and sewer system combination unlimited tax and revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 6.216 percent.</p>
</text>
